[I] Epiphan frame grabber firmware

[T] FPGA bitstreams and Cypress EZ-USB firmware for Epiphan frame grabbers.
[T] Covers 10 FPGA bitstreams (DVI2USB 3.0, SDI2USB 3.0, DVI2USB Duo/Plus/R1/R2,
[T] VGA2USB LR and respins), 7 EZ-USB FX2 8051 images and 2 Cypress FX3 boot
[T] images,

[A] Epiphan Systems Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/firmware
[F] CROSS
[K] + linux

[L] Free-to-use
[V] 3.33.0.17

[D] c8ab6847782750400749bcaa11675c7bc04aa1fb39d5b10573425d14 vga2usb-3.33.0.17-ubuntu-5.4.0-91-generic-x86_64-54546-1829.deb https://ssl.epiphan.com/downloads/linux/Ubuntu/20.04/USB/

autoextract=0 runmake=0

hook_add postmake 5 'sh $confdir/extract-epiphan-fw.sh `match_source_file -p vga2usb` $root/lib/firmware/epiphan/'
